  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Project Planning**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the initial phase, aiming for a comprehensive project plan. Currently, I\'m focusing on dissecting the user\'s explicit request. I am working on outlining the project architecture, frontend page structure, and backend folder structure, as requested.\n\n\n**Refining System Architecture**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the database schema design and API endpoints, followed by authentication. I\'m focusing on admin authorization. Also, I\'m developing a UI/UX design plan. It is important to confirm aspects of the VELoop platform before starting any implementation. I will wait for approval before progressing further. I should create an implementation plan in the specified artifact directory, and it should be user-facing.\n\n\n**Drafting Implementation Details**\n\nI\'m presently focused on the implementation plan, diligently constructing it to align with all specified requirements. I\'ve drafted an `implementation_plan.md` file and will present it, incorporating all 10 requested points, including project architecture, frontend and backend structures, and the database schema. The plan is designed to be user-facing. I\'m keen to get your approval on the specifics soon.\n\n\n**Defining API and Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the concrete implementation specifics. I\'ve defined the database schema (tables: Transaction, UserLevel, Achievement, etc.) and a full API endpoint list (Auth: register, Profile: get me, Admin: stats, etc.). I am structuring the authentication flow with JWT tokens in secure cookies and bcrypt for password hashing. Also, I\'m building admin authorization with role-based middleware.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1397164554930854099"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Comprehensive implementation plan for VELoop Rewards User Profile & Admin Management System (MERN-stack) covering architecture, database schemas, API routes, user profile, protected admin panel, UI/UX design, and development milestones.\",\"UserFacing\":true},\"CodeContent\":\"# VELoop Rewards \342\200\223 User Profile & Admin Management System\\n\\nA production-quality full-stack MERN web application featuring a gamified user profile dashboard and a protected administrative management console.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review & Critical Decisions\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> This plan outlines the complete architecture, database models, REST APIs, frontend components, and security controls for VELoop Rewards. Please review and click **Proceed** to approve this plan.\\n\\n- **Confirmed Decision 1**: Use MongoDB & Mongoose for robust data persistence with zero mock-only persistence.\\n- **Confirmed Decision 2**: Implement JWT-based secure authentication with bcrypt password hashing and role-based admin middleware.\\n- **Confirmed Decision 3**: Design a polished, high-end dark-themed UI (`#161827`) with gold, soft blue, and silver accents adhering strictly to the frontend design constitution.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Overview & Core Concept\\n\\n- **What It Does**: Provides users with a comprehensive gamified profile dashboard to track VEs, SVEs, Gems, Tokens, XP, level progression, achievements, withdrawal history, and referrals. Provides administrators with a secure, full-featured management panel to oversee users, adjust reward balances, manage levels/achievements, approve/reject withdrawals, and review audit logs.\\n- **Target Audience**: Platform members seeking to track rewards and earnings, and administrators managing platform operations.\\n- **Key Value**: Secure, tamper-proof backend data integrity where wallet balances and XP/levels are exclusively controlled by server-side business logic.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Complete Project Architecture\\n\\n```\\nveloop-rewards/\\n\342\224\202\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 server.ts (Express API & Vite Dev Server Middleware)\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 tsconfig.json\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example\\n\342\224\202\\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/ (Frontend - React + Vite + Tailwind CSS)\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.jsx / App.tsx\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.jsx / main.tsx\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ProfileHero/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RewardAssets/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LevelProgress/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AchievementCard/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WithdrawalOverview/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ReferralSnapshot/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RecentActivity/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickActions/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 UserProfile/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Login/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Admin/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdminLogin/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Dashboard/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Users/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Rewards/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Withdrawals/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Referrals/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Levels/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Achievements/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202       \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AuditLogs/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 services/\\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/\\n\342\224\202\\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 server/ (Backend API Modules)\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/db.js\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 models/\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 User.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Wallet.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WalletTransaction.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 UserLevel.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Achievement.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 UserAchievement.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Referral.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 Withdrawal.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ActivityLog.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdminUser.js\\n    \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 AdminAuditLog.js\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 controllers/\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 middleware/\\n    \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 routes/\\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 validators/\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Database Schema Design (MongoDB & Mongoose)\\n\\n1. **User**: `username`, `email`, `passwordHash`, `referralCode`, `referredBy`, `status` (active/suspended), `emailVerified`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`.\\n2. **Wallet**: `userId`, `veBalance`, `sveBalance`, `gemsBalance`, `tokensBalance`, `xpBalance`, `currentLevel`, `updatedAt`.\\n3. **WalletTransaction**: `userId`, `assetType` (VE, SVE, Gems, Tokens, XP), `amount`, `type` (earn, spend, adjust, withdrawal), `referenceId`, `description`, `createdAt`.\\n4. **UserLevel**: `levelNumber`, `levelName`, `xpThreshold`, `badgeUrl`, `isActive`.\\n5. **Achievement**: `title`, `description`, `badgeUrl`, `xpReward`, `criteriaType`, `criteriaValue`, `isActive`.\\n6. **UserAchievement**: `userId`, `achievementId`, `unlockedAt`, `progress`.\\n7. **Referral**: `referrerId`, `referredUserId`, `status` (pending, successful), `rewardEarned`, `xpEarned`, `createdAt`.\\n8. **Withdrawal**: `userId`, `assetType`, `amount`, `status` (pending, approved, rejected, failed), `payoutDetails`, `rejectionReason`, `processedBy`, `createdAt`.\\n9. **ActivityLog**: `userId`, `actionType`, `description`, `metadata`, `createdAt`.\\n10. **AdminUser**: `username`, `email`, `passwordHash`, `role` (super_admin, moderator), `lastLogin`, `createdAt`.\\n11. **AdminAuditLog**: `adminId`, `action`, `targetModel`, `targetId`, `changesSummary`, `ipAddress`, `createdAt`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. API Endpoint List\\n\\n### Authentication\\n- `POST /api/auth/register` - Register a new user\\n- `POST /api/auth/login` - User login\\n- `POST /api/auth/logout` - User logout\\n- `GET /api/auth/me` - Get current authenticated user session\\n\\n### User Profile\\n- `GET /api/profile/me` - Get user profile details\\n- `PATCH /api/profile/me` - Update permitted profile details\\n- `GET /api/profile/rewards` - Get wallet balances for VEs, SVEs, Gems, Tokens, XP\\n- `GET /api/profile/level-progress` - Get current level, XP, and progress toward next level\\n- `GET /api/profile/achievements` - Get unlocked and upcoming achievements\\n- `GET /api/profile/withdrawal-summary` - Get withdrawal request stats and history\\n- `GET /api/profile/referrals` - Get referral snapshot and statistics\\n- `GET /api/profile/activity` - Get recent user activity feed\\n\\n### Admin Management\\n- `POST /api/admin/auth/login` - Admin login (with seeded demo credentials)\\n- `GET /api/admin/stats` - Platform overview statistics\\n- `GET /api/admin/users` - Paginated user list with search/filter\\n- `GET /api/admin/users/:id` - Detailed user view (wallet, activity, referrals)\\n- `PATCH /api/admin/users/:id/status` - Suspend or restore user account\\n- `POST /api/admin/rewards/adjust` - Adjust user wallet balances (with audit trail)\\n- `GET /api/admin/withdrawals` - List withdrawal requests with status filter\\n- `PATCH /api/admin/withdrawals/:id/status` - Approve or reject withdrawal request\\n- `GET /api/admin/audit-logs` - System administration audit log trail\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. UI/UX Design Plan\\n\\n- **Theme & Palette**: Deep navy background (`#161827`), cool slate structural cards (`#1E293B`), gold & warm yellow accent (`#F59E0B`), soft blue (`#3B82F6`), and silver highlights.\\n- **Design Rules**: Zero pill badges for static metadata, clean typographic separators (`\302\267`), strict tabular numerals (`tabular-nums`) for financial balances and XP, single-elevation depth, mobile-first responsiveness (320px to 1920px).\\n- **Interactive Feedback**: Loading skeletons, empty states with clear calls to action, toast notifications for copy actions and form submissions.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Development Milestones\\n\\n- **Milestone 1**: Project configuration, database setup, and Mongoose models.\\n- **Milestone 2**: Backend REST API controllers, authentication middleware, and seed script (including demo admin).\\n- **Milestone 3**: React frontend routing, authentication context, and User Profile Dashboard components.\\n- **Milestone 4**: Protected Admin Panel dashboard, user management, reward adjustment, and withdrawal processing.\\n- **Milestone 5**: Security hardening, testing, and documentation (`README.md`, `API_DOCUMENTATION.md`, `DEMO_ACCESS.md`).\\n\",\"Description\":\"Created comprehensive implementation plan for VELoop Rewards.\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"toolAction\":\"Creating implementation plan\",\"toolSummary\":\"Implementation plan artifact\"}"
