      <CheckCircle className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Unlocked\n                  </span>\n                ) : (\n                  <span className=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1\">\n                    <Lock className=\"w-3 h-3\" /> Locked\n                  </span>\n                )}\n              </div>\n\n              <h3 className=\"text-base font-bold text-white mb-1\">{ach.title}</h3>\n              <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mb-3\">{ach.description}</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"pt-3 border-t border-slate-800/80 flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n              <span className=\"text-amber-400 font-mono font-semibold\">+{formatNumber(ach.xpReward)} XP</span>\n              <span className=\"text-slate-500 font-mono\">{ach.progress}% Complete</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        ))}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n};\n"
