  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully built and verified the complete **VELoop Rewards \342\200\223 User Profile & Admin Management System** full-stack web application.\n\n### Summary of What Was Built\n\n1. **Backend API & Architecture (Node.js & Express / Mongoose)**:\n   - Configured MongoDB models and schemas for Users, Wallets, Wallet Transactions, Level Configurations, Achievements, User Achievements, Referrals, Withdrawals, Activity Logs, Admin Users, and Admin Audit Logs.\n   - Built robust REST API endpoints for user registration, login, profile management, reward balance tracking, level progression calculation, achievements, withdrawal requests, and referral snapshots.\n   - Implemented secure JWT authentication with `bcrypt` password hashing and role-based administrative middleware.\n   - Seeded default demo credentials (`alex@veloop.io` / `password123` for members and `admin@veloop.io` / `Admin@123` for administrators).\n\n2. **Frontend React User Profile Dashboard (`/user-profile`)**:\n   - **Profile Hero Section**: Displays avatar initials, user ID with copy-to-clipboard action, email, account status badge, current level title, and XP progress bar.\n   - **Reward Assets Section**: Showcases VEs, SVEs, Gems, Platform Tokens, and XP balances with distinct visual styling, icons, and explanations.\n   - **Level Progression & Achievements**: Visualizes current level thresholds, remaining XP, unlocked and upcoming badges.\n   - **Withdrawal Overview**: Summary of withdrawal statistics with status badges and request modal.\n   - **Referral Snapshot**: Referral code sharing with copy link button and referral list.\n   - **Recent Activity Feed & Quick Actions**: Interactive buttons for instant user actions.\n\n3. **Protected Admin Panel (`/admin/dashboard`)**:\n   - **Platform Overview Statistics**: Real-time user counts, token distributions, and pending withdrawal counts.\n   - **User Management**: Searchable user directory with account status toggles (Suspend/Restore) and administrative wallet balance adjustments.\n   - **Withdrawal Approvals**: Review queue for pending withdrawals with Approve/Reject actions.\n   - **Audit Logs**: Comprehensive tracking of all administrative actions."
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and verified the complete **VELoop Rewards \342\200\223 User Profile & Admin Management System** full-stack web application.\n\n### Summary of What Was Built\n\n1. **Backend API & Architecture (Node.js & Express / Mongoose)**:\n   - Configured MongoDB models and schemas for Users, Wallets, Wallet Transactions, Level Configurations, Achievements, User Achievements, Referrals, Withdrawals, Activity Logs, Admin Users, and Admin Audit Logs.\n   - Built robust REST API endpoints for user registration, login, profile management, reward balance tracking, level progression calculation, achievements, withdrawal requests, and referral snapshots.\n   - Implemented secure JWT authentication with `bcrypt` password hashing and role-based administrative middleware.\n   - Seeded default demo credentials (`alex@veloop.io` / `password123` for members and `admin@veloop.io` / `Admin@123` for administrators).\n\n2. **Frontend React User Profile Dashboard (`/user-profile`)**:\n   - **Profile Hero Section**: Displays avatar initials, user ID with copy-to-clipboard action, email, account status badge, current level title, and XP progress bar.\n   - **Reward Assets Section**: Showcases VEs, SVEs, Gems, Platform Tokens, and XP balances with distinct visual styling, icons, and explanations.\n   - **Level Progression & Achievements**: Visualizes current level thresholds, remaining XP, unlocked and upcoming badges.\n   - **Withdrawal Overview**: Summary of withdrawal statistics with status badges and request modal.\n   - **Referral Snapshot**: Referral code sharing with copy link button and referral list.\n   - **Recent Activity Feed & Quick Actions**: Interactive buttons for instant user actions.\n\n3. **Protected Admin Panel (`/admin/dashboard`)**:\n   - **Platform Overview Statistics**: Real-time user counts, token distributions, and pending withdrawal counts.\n   - **User Management**: Searchable user directory with account status toggles (Suspend/Restore) and administrative wallet balance adjustments.\n   - **Withdrawal Approvals**: Review queue for pending withdrawals with Approve/Reject actions.\n   - **Audit Logs**: Comprehensive tracking of all administrative actions."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\277\003\n\274\003\001i\024}\023\263\202\232\214\273\211a\302-\036\203\004:)\360\3639V\210*\245S\241\0232{\320\245#\365\345T\342]Hl\233\272\271\272\274*\210Wo\361x1\235z\263n\024#V\003y\363\326\001\353\214\376\321hYr\221\206R\230%\177~\376\351\326\027ti\260\362\000\272\334(\\ G\032U;l\344\241IM\232\0354\241\207\034\325\370y\030\035\307h\346\035\v\271L]\3461\322\256\367\347\035\221\207\320@\220?&\347r^\345\212\330%2\343t\r\022\315\364\226\315\277\362\216\024)\215\374\201\243\341\302!V0\207\177u\fyg\277\001\335\326+\210`}ZDF\037\376\003\365j\220A\307M!\321\216_\272\027\333\017\330\201\202\255\"h\350\324\330\\[\250\004\273\203:+\021\276\257JI\355\344!K\235\233\313RH\215\374v\235\372e\273^\301\021\203\002b&\022\177o\367\032.\203[\244\214\274\003g\227\262\tW\017\033^\346{\246-\02311lL=\321RU\037M\230.\307n\200\260\341\177\350 Q\320\342\312\031\vxE\216\345^\354d\304\341F,\025\211\321U\334\024\211r3\031\224\320>\274\335\311v\277,\302l\000F\212\027CqF\026\237\244\257${\352\370j:\374\341\vO\270w\000\177\275\260\344y\001\v\351xS\346\200\310\272\323\230<FI\017\037\211B\305\237\027\305\025\307ifx\b\331\306r[|i\3569s\225\2732\205\350\333<\227\242\243p\272\207k0\220n\355\320p\350\3774\251\266>\363\225\231\247\003l\310\270\310\224t\177L\021--\365S\304\370\201%:$\""
