  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining The Approach**\n\nI\'ve taken the feedback to heart and am now pivoting the project\'s foundation. The plan is to implement Bootstrap alongside CSS Modules for styling, which I\'m confident will be an upgrade. Additionally, I\'m segregating the frontend (React + Vite) and backend (Node.js + Express) into distinct folders to maintain a clean and organized structure.\n\n\n**Building Backend Framework**\n\nI\'m currently focused on establishing the backend foundation. I\'ve initiated the project and set up the `backend/` directory, including key subfolders like `src/`, `config/`, and `routes/`. My next steps involve installing dependencies, configuring Express and MongoDB with Mongoose, and adding environment variable handling and a health-check endpoint. I\'m also planning proper error-handling middleware.\n\n\n"
