  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Database Models**\n\nI\'ve successfully connected to the MongoDB database. I\'m now transitioning into defining the database models and authentication APIs. My focus is currently on constructing Mongoose schemas for the `User` and `Wallet` entities. I\'ll define fields like usernames, email, password hashes, referral codes, status, and email verification for the `User` model, and user ID for the `Wallet` model.\n\n\n**Expanding Database Models**\n\nI\'m now detailing additional database models. I\'m focusing on `WalletTransaction`, `UserLevel`, `Achievement`, and other supporting schemas. I\'m working through fields like `assetType`, `amount`, `criteriaType`, and other fields to ensure a robust data structure. I\'m also planning the corresponding authentication controllers and routes, including secure password hashing with bcrypt, input validation, and JWT token issuance.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_3420525667824907280"
      name: "write_to_file"
