  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully completed **Milestone 3: Profile & Admin Management APIs**.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of What Was Built\n\n1. **User Profile APIs (`backend/src/controllers/profileController.js`, `backend/src/routes/profileRoutes.js`)**:\n   - `GET /api/profile/me`: Retrieves user details and wallet balances.\n   - `PATCH /api/profile/me`: Updates profile data.\n   - `GET /api/profile/rewards`: Fetches reward assets and transaction logs.\n   - `GET /api/profile/level-progress`: Calculates level progression, current XP, and next milestone.\n   - `GET /api/profile/achievements`: Fetches user achievements and unlock status.\n   - `GET /api/profile/withdrawal-summary`: Summarizes withdrawal requests and history.\n   - `GET /api/profile/referrals`: Provides referral snapshot and referred member details.\n   - `GET /api/profile/activity`: Retrieves recent activity logs.\n\n2. **Admin Management APIs (`backend/src/controllers/adminController.js`, `backend/src/routes/adminRoutes.js`)**:\n   - `GET /api/admin/stats`: Platform overview statistics.\n   - `GET /api/admin/users`: Paginated user list with search & status filters.\n   - `GET /api/admin/users/:id`: Detailed user inspection.\n   - `PATCH /api/admin/users/:id/status`: Suspend or restore user accounts.\n   - `POST /api/admin/rewards/adjust`: Adjusts user wallet balances with auditable transactions and audit logs.\n   - `GET /api/admin/withdrawals` & `PATCH /api/admin/withdrawals/:id/status`: Withdrawal review and approval/rejection queue.\n   - `GET /api/admin/levels`, `GET /api/admin/achievements`, `GET /api/admin/referrals`, `GET /api/admin/activity`, `GET /api/admin/audit-logs`: Comprehensive system inspection endpoints.\n\n---\n\nPlease review Milestone 3 and provide your approval to proceed to **Milestone 4: Frontend Development (Bootstrap + CSS Modules)**."
    modified_response: "I have successfully completed **Milestone 3: Profile & Admin Management APIs**.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of What Was Built\n\n1. **User Profile APIs (`backend/src/controllers/profileController.js`, `backend/src/routes/profileRoutes.js`)**:\n   - `GET /api/profile/me`: Retrieves user details and wallet balances.\n   - `PATCH /api/profile/me`: Updates profile data.\n   - `GET /api/profile/rewards`: Fetches reward assets and transaction logs.\n   - `GET /api/profile/level-progress`: Calculates level progression, current XP, and next milestone.\n   - `GET /api/profile/achievements`: Fetches user achievements and unlock status.\n   - `GET /api/profile/withdrawal-summary`: Summarizes withdrawal requests and history.\n   - `GET /api/profile/referrals`: Provides referral snapshot and referred member details.\n   - `GET /api/profile/activity`: Retrieves recent activity logs.\n\n2. **Admin Management APIs (`backend/src/controllers/adminController.js`, `backend/src/routes/adminRoutes.js`)**:\n   - `GET /api/admin/stats`: Platform overview statistics.\n   - `GET /api/admin/users`: Paginated user list with search & status filters.\n   - `GET /api/admin/users/:id`: Detailed user inspection.\n   - `PATCH /api/admin/users/:id/status`: Suspend or restore user accounts.\n   - `POST /api/admin/rewards/adjust`: Adjusts user wallet balances with auditable transactions and audit logs.\n   - `GET /api/admin/withdrawals` & `PATCH /api/admin/withdrawals/:id/status`: Withdrawal review and approval/rejection queue.\n   - `GET /api/admin/levels`, `GET /api/admin/achievements`, `GET /api/admin/referrals`, `GET /api/admin/activity`, `GET /api/admin/audit-logs`: Comprehensive system inspection endpoints.\n\n---\n\nPlease review Milestone 3 and provide your approval to proceed to **Milestone 4: Frontend Development (Bootstrap + CSS Modules)**."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\231\002\n\226\002\001i\024}\023\243D\334\241\345q\035\375y\205EP\273\nE\355\031\317\222\3331\232\277\245\260\213B\267\367\227\346\251\253\2138\214\024U\202}\257\020\2139\334\033,I\001\031A\215\266\264\306a\035\347\034P\261Ij\256MJ.\016\177w\237\214\204pL\002\227vx\303\241\217\223\035S\356\302\373\tb\030wm\225q\r`K\340\230\313\242\240\2743\361s\205\331A2\307N\346 M\024\211u\365\214\247Z\037\243\327\336\321\305\323\a99\376+\346I#\313\036\203\207\\\024\253*;4\021\177!nv\337\016\317\016\357\037\242\340\0351i6Z\v\263\036t\002\212\360a(H\366$c\027{\3710p\321l_\362^\211)\266\017\237\320[w\250\343\276\300In\226\204\317\346\365\306\233\355\217\002\242\225\237J\252\211v\246\r\312T\003\231\246h\242\020\261\337\375\271@\034T\261.\263l\'\346\235\022O\006\n\3133G,K@\303\317L\350\231=A$%\021\314\000\261\306\256n\034\001\232"
