  planner_response {
    response: "I have successfully completed **Milestone 4: Frontend Development (Bootstrap + CSS Modules)**.\n\n---\n\n### Summary of What Was Built\n\n1. **Bootstrap & CSS Modules Integration**:\n   - Integrated Bootstrap 5 and Google Fonts via CDN in `index.html`.\n   - Replaced all Tailwind utility classes across components and pages (`ProfileHero`, `RewardAssets`, `LevelProgress`, `AchievementCard`, `WithdrawalOverview`, `ReferralSnapshot`, `RecentActivity`, `QuickActions`, `Navbar`) with clean, modular CSS modules (`.module.css`) and standard Bootstrap classes (`container`, `row`, `col`, `card`, `btn`, `badge`, `progress`, `table`).\n2. **User Profile Dashboard & Admin Panel**:\n   - Fully interactive views connected to the backend APIs.\n\n---\n\nPlease review Milestone 4 and provide your approval to proceed to **Milestone 5: Security Hardening, Testing & Documentation**."
