  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Withdrawal Route**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the `POST /api/profile/withdraw` route within `server/routes/api.ts`. My key consideration is the user withdrawal flow. I\'ve begun to outline the critical validations that need to occur: authentication via `verifyUserToken` is the first check, followed by verifying the withdrawal `amount` is positive, and the `assetType` is valid.\n\n\n**Refining Withdrawal Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the withdrawal process. I\'m focusing on wallet balance validation, ensuring the amount is available, and handling insufficient funds. I\'m also planning to create \'pending\' `Withdrawal` documents, and corresponding `WalletTransaction` and `ActivityLog` entries. Furthermore, I\'ve confirmed that the front-end withdrawal form in `UserProfilePage.tsx` will use the intended API endpoint. I\'m also going to prevent direct wallet modification by reviewing `PATCH /api/profile/me`.\n\n\n"
