  code_action {
    action_spec {
      create_file {
        instruction: "# VELoop Rewards \342\200\223 User Profile & Admin Management System\n\nA production-ready full-stack MERN (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js) web application designed for a premier gamified rewards platform. It features a complete User Profile Dashboard and a protected Administrative Control Panel with robust role-based access control (RBAC).\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\237 Key Features\n\n### User Profile Application (`/user-profile`)\n- **Profile Hero**: User display name, profile initials avatar, copyable User ID, verified email, account status, current tier, and dynamic XP progress bar.\n- **Your Rewards Assets**: Distinct visual representation for all five platform reward assets:\n  - **VEs (VELoop Earnings)**: Primary convertible reward currency.\n  - **SVEs (Silver Vault Earnings)**: Secured vault earnings.\n  - **Gems**: Utility gems for boosts and redemptions.\n  - **Tokens**: Ecosystem and governance liquidity tokens.\n  - **XP**: Progression metric for account level advancement (non-withdrawable).\n- **Level Progression**: Real-time XP tracking, current title, next level preview, and dynamic progress bar computed strictly on the backend.\n- **Achievements & Badges**: Unlocked and locked badges, milestone criteria, and unlock progress.\n- **Withdrawal Overview**: Summary of total, pending, approved, and rejected requests, plus an interactive withdrawal request modal with balance validation.\n- **Referral Snapshot**: Unique referral code generation, one-click link copying, total referrals, rewards accrued, and referred members list.\n- **Recent Activity**: Live audit feed of rewards earned, level ups, and withdrawal actions.\n- **Gmail Notification Integration**: Google OAuth integration allowing users to send level-up reward emails and read notifications from their mailbox.\n\n### Protected Admin Management Panel (`/admin/dashboard`)\n- **Protected Access**: Enforced by JWT admin authorization middleware; access restricted to authenticated administrators.\n- **Platform Analytics**: Total users, active/suspended ratios, platform-wide VE/Token distributions, and pending withdrawal queue counts.\n- **User Management**: Search users by name/email, view comprehensive user profiles, inspect wallet balances, and suspend or restore accounts.\n- **Reward Balance Adjustment**: Adjust any user\'s balance with mandatory administrator reason logging and transaction audit records.\n- **Withdrawal Review & Approval**: Review pending requests and approve or reject them with policy reason tracking.\n- **Administrative Audit Logs**: Immutable system-wide audit trail recording administrator ID, action, target entity, timestamp, and changes.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Technology Stack\n\n- **Frontend**: React 19, Vite, Bootstrap 5, CSS Modules (`.module.css`), Lucide React, React Router DOM v7.\n- **Backend**: Node.js, Express.js (ES Modules), Mongoose.\n- **Database**: MongoDB (Atlas or local replica set) with in-memory fallback for hermetic preview safety.\n- **Authentication**: JSON Web Tokens (JWT), bcryptjs password hashing.\n- **Integrations**: Google Workspace Gmail API via OAuth 2.0.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\232\200 Getting Started\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Node.js (v18 or higher)\n- npm or bun\n- MongoDB instance (MongoDB Atlas URI or local MongoDB)\n\n### Installation & Local Setup\n\n1. **Clone the repository**:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/your-username/veloop-rewards.git\n   cd veloop-rewards\n   ```\n\n2. **Install dependencies**:\n   ```bash\n   npm install\n   ```\n\n3. **Configure Environment Variables**:\n   Copy the example environment template:\n   ```bash\n   cp .env.example .env\n   ```\n   Fill in your configuration details:\n   ```env\n   PORT=3000\n   MONGO_URI=\"mongodb+srv://<username>:<password>@cluster.mongodb.net/veloop_rewards?retryWrites=true&w=majority\"\n   JWT_SECRET=\"veloop_super_secret_jwt_key_2026\"\n   ADMIN_EMAIL=\"admin@veloop.io\"\n   ADMIN_PASSWORD=\"Admin@123\"\n   NODE_ENV=\"development\"\n   ```\n\n4. **Start the Application**:\n   ```bash\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n   The unified server will start on `http://localhost:3000`.\n\n5. **Standalone Backend Mode** (Optional):\n   ```bash\n   cd backend\n   npm install\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\223\201 Project Structure\n\n```text\nveloop-rewards/\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 server.ts                       # Integrated Express API & Vite dev server\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json                    # Root package configuration\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 .env.example                    # Environment variable template\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 server/                         # Unified backend TypeScript modules\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/                     # Database configuration\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 data/                       # In-memory store fallback for offline preview\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 middleware/                 # Auth & role verification middleware\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 models/                     # Mongoose schemas & TypeScript types\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 routes/                     # Express API routes\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 seed.ts                     # Database seeder for demo accounts\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 backend/                        # Standalone Express.js Node backend\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 config/db.js\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 controllers/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 middleware/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 models/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 routes/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 seed.js\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 server.js\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 package.json\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 src/                            # React Frontend\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 components/                 # Bootstrap + CSS Module components\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ProfileHero/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RewardAssets/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 LevelProgress/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 AchievementCard/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 WithdrawalOverview/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 ReferralSnapshot/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 RecentActivity/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 QuickActions/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 GmailIntegration/\n\342\224\202   \342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 Navbar.tsx\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 context/                    # AuthContext for session management\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 pages/                      # Page components (UserProfile, Login, AdminDashboard)\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 utils/                      # Formatting & clipboard helpers\n\342\224\202   \342\224\234\342\224\200\342\224\200 App.tsx                     # React Router routes\n\342\224\202   \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 main.tsx                    # React DOM entry\n\342\224\202\n\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 postman/                        # Postman API Collection\n    \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200 veloop_rewards.postman_collection.json\n```\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 License\nDistributed under the Apache-2.0 License.\n"
        path {
          absolute_uri: "file:///README.md"
        }
        overwrite: true
      }
    }
