              text: "### User Profile Application (`/user-profile`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Profile Hero**: User display name, profile initials avatar, copyable User ID, verified email, account status, current tier, and dynamic XP progress bar."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Your Rewards Assets**: Distinct visual representation for all five platform reward assets:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **VEs (VELoop Earnings)**: Primary convertible reward currency."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **SVEs (Silver Vault Earnings)**: Secured vault earnings."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Gems**: Utility gems for boosts and redemptions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Tokens**: Ecosystem and governance liquidity tokens."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **XP**: Progression metric for account level advancement (non-withdrawable)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Level Progression**: Real-time XP tracking, current title, next level preview, and dynamic progress bar computed strictly on the backend."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Achievements & Badges**: Unlocked and locked badges, milestone criteria, and unlock progress."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Withdrawal Overview**: Summary of total, pending, approved, and rejected requests, plus an interactive withdrawal request modal with balance validation."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Referral Snapshot**: Unique referral code generation, one-click link copying, total referrals, rewards accrued, and referred members list."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Recent Activity**: Live audit feed of rewards earned, level ups, and withdrawal actions."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Gmail Notification Integration**: Google OAuth integration allowing users to send level-up reward emails and read notifications from their mailbox."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Protected Admin Management Panel (`/admin/dashboard`)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Protected Access**: Enforced by JWT admin authorization middleware; access restricted to authenticated administrators."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Platform Analytics**: Total users, active/suspended ratios, platform-wide VE/Token distributions, and pending withdrawal queue counts."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **User Management**: Search users by name/email, view comprehensive user profiles, inspect wallet balances, and suspend or restore accounts."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Reward Balance Adjustment**: Adjust any user\'s balance with mandatory administrator reason logging and transaction audit records."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Withdrawal Review & Approval**: Review pending requests and approve or reject them with policy reason tracking."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Administrative Audit Logs**: Immutable system-wide audit trail recording administrator ID, action, target entity, timestamp, and changes."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Technology Stack"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Frontend**: React 19, Vite, Bootstrap 5, CSS Modules (`.module.css`), Lucide React, React Router DOM v7."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Backend**: Node.js, Express.js (ES Modules), Mongoose."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Database**: MongoDB (Atlas or local replica set) with in-memory fallback for hermetic preview safety."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Authentication**: JSON Web Tokens (JWT), bcryptjs password hashing."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Integrations**: Google Workspace Gmail API via OAuth 2.0."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## \360\237\232\200 Getting Started"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "### Prerequisites"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- Node.js (v18 or higher)"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- npm or bun"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
