  planner_response {
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10085573207006860825"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# VELoop Rewards \342\200\223 REST API Documentation\\n\\nThis document describes all RESTful API endpoints available in the VELoop Rewards system, including authentication requirements, request/response payloads, and status codes.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Base URL\\n- Local Dev Server: `http://localhost:3000/api`\\n- Standalone Backend: `http://localhost:5000/api`\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Authentication Mechanism\\nAll protected endpoints require a JWT token passed in the `Authorization` header:\\n```text\\nAuthorization: Bearer <jwt_token>\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Authentication APIs\\n\\n### 1.1 Register Member\\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/register`\\n- **Access**: Public\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance\\\",\\n    \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n    \\\"password\\\": \\\"password123\\\",\\n    \\\"referralCode\\\": \\\"OPTIONAL_REFERRAL_CODE\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n- **Response (201 Created)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Registration successful\\\",\\n    \\\"token\\\": \\\"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsIn...\\\",\\n    \\\"user\\\": {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"673f1a2b...\\\",\\n      \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance\\\",\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n      \\\"referralCode\\\": \\\"ALEX9482\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 1.2 Login Member\\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/login`\\n- **Access**: Public\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n    \\\"password\\\": \\\"password123\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Login successful\\\",\\n    \\\"token\\\": \\\"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsIn...\\\",\\n    \\\"user\\\": {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"673f1a2b...\\\",\\n      \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance\\\",\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n      \\\"referralCode\\\": \\\"ALEX2026\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 1.3 Verify Current User Session\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/auth/me`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"user\\\": {\\n      \\\"_id\\\": \\\"673f1a2b...\\\",\\n      \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance\\\",\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n      \\\"referralCode\\\": \\\"ALEX2026\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\",\\n      \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 1.4 Admin Login\\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/auth/admin/login` or `POST /api/admin/auth/login`\\n- **Access**: Public\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"email\\\": \\\"admin@veloop.io\\\",\\n    \\\"password\\\": \\\"Admin@123\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Admin login successful\\\",\\n    \\\"token\\\": \\\"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsIn...\\\",\\n    \\\"admin\\\": {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"673f1a99...\\\",\\n      \\\"username\\\": \\\"SuperAdmin\\\",\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"admin@veloop.io\\\",\\n      \\\"role\\\": \\\"super_admin\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. User Profile APIs\\n\\n### 2.1 Get Current User Profile & Wallet\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/profile/me`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"user\\\": {\\n      \\\"_id\\\": \\\"673f1a2b...\\\",\\n      \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance\\\",\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"alex@veloop.io\\\",\\n      \\\"referralCode\\\": \\\"ALEX2026\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"active\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"wallet\\\": {\\n      \\\"veBalance\\\": 2450,\\n      \\\"sveBalance\\\": 480,\\n      \\\"gemsBalance\\\": 125,\\n      \\\"tokensBalance\\\": 890,\\n      \\\"xpBalance\\\": 6420,\\n      \\\"currentLevel\\\": 4\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 2.2 Update Profile\\n- **Endpoint**: `PATCH /api/profile/me`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance Jr.\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Profile updated successfully\\\",\\n    \\\"user\\\": { \\\"username\\\": \\\"Alex Vance Jr.\\\" }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 2.3 Get Reward Assets & Transaction History\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/profile/rewards`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"wallet\\\": {\\n      \\\"veBalance\\\": 2450,\\n      \\\"sveBalance\\\": 480,\\n      \\\"gemsBalance\\\": 125,\\n      \\\"tokensBalance\\\": 890,\\n      \\\"xpBalance\\\": 6420\\n    },\\n    \\\"transactions\\\": [\\n      {\\n        \\\"assetType\\\": \\\"VE\\\",\\n        \\\"amount\\\": 500,\\n        \\\"type\\\": \\\"earn\\\",\\n        \\\"description\\\": \\\"Daily login bonus\\\",\\n        \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z\\\"\\n      }\\n    ]\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 2.4 Get Level Progression\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/profile/level-progress`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"currentLevel\\\": 4,\\n    \\\"levelName\\\": \\\"Reward Explorer\\\",\\n    \\\"currentXp\\\": 6420,\\n    \\\"requiredXp\\\": 8000,\\n    \\\"remainingXp\\\": 1580,\\n    \\\"progressPercent\\\": 80,\\n    \\\"nextLevelName\\\": \\\"Elite Vanguard\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 2.5 Submit Withdrawal Request\\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/profile/withdraw`\\n- **Access**: Protected (User Token)\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"assetType\\\": \\\"VE\\\",\\n    \\\"amount\\\": 100,\\n    \\\"payoutDetails\\\": \\\"0x71C...392A\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n- **Response (201 Created)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"message\\\": \\\"Withdrawal request submitted successfully\\\",\\n    \\\"withdrawal\\\": {\\n      \\\"_id\\\": \\\"673f...\\\",\\n      \\\"assetType\\\": \\\"VE\\\",\\n      \\\"amount\\\": 100,\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"pending\\\",\\n      \\\"payoutDetails\\\": \\\"0x71C...392A\\\",\\n      \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z\\\"\\n    }\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Administrative APIs\\n\\n### 3.1 Get Platform Stats\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/admin/stats`\\n- **Access**: Protected (Admin Token)\\n- **Response (200 OK)**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"totalUsers\\\": 25,\\n    \\\"activeUsers\\\": 24,\\n    \\\"suspendedUsers\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"totalVe\\\": 54200,\\n    \\\"totalSve\\\": 12000,\\n    \\\"totalGems\\\": 3500,\\n    \\\"totalTokens\\\": 18200,\\n    \\\"totalWithdrawals\\\": 12,\\n    \\\"pendingWithdrawals\\\": 3,\\n    \\\"approvedWithdrawals\\\": 9\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 3.2 List Users\\n- **Endpoint**: `GET /api/admin/users?search=alex&status=active`\\n- **Access**: Protected (Admin Token)\\n\\n### 3.3 Update User Account Status\\n- **Endpoint**: `PATCH /api/admin/users/:id/status`\\n- **Access**: Protected (Admin Token)\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"suspended\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 3.4 Adjust Wallet Balance (Audited)\\n- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/admin/rewards/adjust`\\n- **Access**: Protected (Admin Token)\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"userId\\\": \\\"673f1a2b...\\\",\\n    \\\"assetType\\\": \\\"VE\\\",\\n    \\\"amount\\\": 100,\\n    \\\"reason\\\": \\\"Challenge victory bonus compensation\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n### 3.5 Approve or Reject Withdrawal\\n- **Endpoint**: `PATCH /api/admin/withdrawals/:id/status`\\n- **Access**: Protected (Admin Token)\\n- **Request Body**:\\n  ```json\\n  {\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"approved\\\"\\n  }\\n  ```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. HTTP Status Code Conventions\\n- `200 OK`: Request succeeded.\\n- `201 Created`: Resource successfully created.\\n- `400 Bad Request`: Validation failure or insufficient balance.\\n- `401 Unauthorized`: Missing, invalid, or expired authentication token.\\n- `403 Forbidden`: Insufficient role permissions or suspended account.\\n- `404 Not Found`: Requested resource not found.\\n- `500 Internal Server Error`: Unhandled server exception.\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create comprehensive API_DOCUMENTATION.md file.\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/API_DOCUMENTATION.md\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating API_DOCUMENTATION.md\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create API_DOCUMENTATION.md\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\212\002\n\207\002\001i\024}\023\316\342\342\240\225\2473\262q\262rX\002\362\324\205vO\257\366\346\267\b\272\213\306qF\215\354\233\235w\305\370F\036-r\026\354[ \277\3227\370\016p(j\252\332\347^.\324\004\016\2016,c\301\233%\360\341\246K\351II\f\241\303\345\316\345\255]\306\340\r\201\004\017\214\304\361!)g\260R\372\020]I%\307|~\322}\325\361&\374y\003v\353\025\352\212\033\275|\204\202\203X\234\361\221\003\"\317\200J\222\341\242t\372\307\017\336\aS\255\232\210D\316K\230\331BM\"\351\"\271?EF\361\303\265X\022\340\324\360\272\313\241\322\327DR>H\'b?\355\211-kFK\265\r\263\351\314}-\222o\021{\212\"mW\331\356\240\215\b\3057\242\024\341\253\276u\032\t[w\267~:Z\264\335i\034F\346l\361=\361]\200\032c\331y%\031 \247\300\227\260\260Q\234\021\\\001\271 \225w\203\271\277\034\254"
